sunvox_tune_modern.sunvox = tests/m3/fixtures/sunvox_tune.sunvox loaded and re-saved with the official SunVox Library 2.1.4d
(sv_load + sv_save), so the song file version field is the modern VERS 2.1.4.3 that the 2009 BSD engine (I706a) refuses.
Derived from the example tune of the public SunVox engine source release (see sunvox_tune.sunvox.SOURCE for its origin and
licence note); Johan decides if it stays public.
